            "description": {
              "content": "**This endpoint allows you to remove an IP address from warmup mode.**\n\nYour request will return a 204 status code if the specified IP was successfully removed from warmup mode. To retrieve details of the IP’s warmup status *before* removing it from warmup mode, call the  \"Retrieve the warmpup status for a specific IP address\" endpoint.",
